	// Design note on base terrains and wonders: Base terrain sprites, BT's and NW's, cannot have alpha
	//   transparency pixels or the tile will not render. 24-bit only non-alpha sprites!
	//   Nor can either be placed in an images subfolder like paths and rivers are.

	// For more edge/decor control:	
	// [*-shoreline] base terrain clones are for edgeless land->water tiles
	// [*-shore] water tile clones remove all adjacent water-land edging
	// Cloned tile sprite png's and entity blocks should be identical. Define Edges/ edges for BT's, none for shores.
	//   RuleVariant alias cloning doesn't work for this purpose.

    // Elevations:
    // Elevation scheme - water level is e0. Land is generally e1+, with exceptions.
    // The purpose is to allow expected visibility of water surface level as adjacent land will always be higher than water level.
